<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" version="31.4.5" type="device" agent="Codex drawio-skill">
  <diagram id="ai-research-conceptual-erd" name="Platform BE Conceptual ERD" data-source="BRD BR-03, BRule-01; PRD §9 flow, §10 permission model, §11 projects, §12 datasets, §43 notifications, §44 entities; popper-v2/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §4 run status, §4.1 research context and review, §10 publication" data-model="Conceptual level: the business entities Platform BE manages, their named relationships and crow's-foot cardinality; no attributes, keys or storage detail. Read each relationship name from the entity at the 'one' (or 'zero or one') end toward the other entity. Project is the top-level scope: BRD/PRD define no organization above it. A Run is carried out by Popper; the scientific content Popper produces inside a run is in the overall Conceptual ERD, not here. Every entity also records the user who created it; only the user links that carry a business rule are drawn.">
